{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:PredictedSpectra.EllipticStabilityLocus","@type":"LeanModule","name":"PredictedSpectra.EllipticStabilityLocus","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Complex.Basic"],"declarations":20,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.no_affine_match","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.no_affine_match","kind":"theorem","line":115,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L115-L135","doc":"**Affine obstruction.** For real `z`, real `p ≠ 0` and `c > 0`, no complex `α`\nscales the depressed color cubic onto the depressed stability cubic\n(`P_C = α² P_S`, `Q_C = α³ Q_S`): the invariant `J` is positive for (C) and\nnegative for (S). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stab_disc_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stab_disc_pos","kind":"theorem","line":105,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L105-L113","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabP_neg","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabP_neg","kind":"theorem","line":100,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L100-L103","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.color_disc_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.color_disc_pos","kind":"theorem","line":95,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L95-L98","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorP_pos","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorP_pos","kind":"theorem","line":92,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L92-L93","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabQ_ofReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabQ_ofReal","kind":"theorem","line":89,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L89-L90","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabP_ofReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabP_ofReal","kind":"theorem","line":87,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L87-L88","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorQ_ofReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorQ_ofReal","kind":"theorem","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L85-L86","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorP_ofReal","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorP_ofReal","kind":"theorem","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L83-L84","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabQ","kind":"def","line":80,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L80-L81","doc":"Depressed constant coefficient of the stability cubic (S). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.stabP","kind":"def","line":78,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L78-L79","doc":"Depressed linear coefficient of the stability cubic (S). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorQ","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorQ","kind":"def","line":76,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L76-L77","doc":"Depressed constant coefficient of the color elliptic cubic (C). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorP","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.colorP","kind":"def","line":74,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L74-L75","doc":"Depressed linear coefficient of the color elliptic cubic (C). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.cubicInvariant_scale","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.cubicInvariant_scale","kind":"theorem","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L67-L72","doc":"Affine-invariance of the cubic invariant. If `P' = α² P` and `Q' = α³ Q`, then\n`4P'³ · (4P³ + 27Q²) = 4P³ · (4P'³ + 27Q'²)`, i.e. `J = 4P³/(4P³+27Q²)` is unchanged. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus.integer_point_identification","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus.integer_point_identification","kind":"theorem","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L43-L43","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus.weierstrass_form","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus.weierstrass_form","kind":"theorem","line":42,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L42-L42","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus.mk","kind":"ctor","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L41-L41","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.EllipticStabilityLocus","kind":"class","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L40-L43","doc":"**Elliptic-stability-locus conjecture** (class-axiomatized per §3b-cond). ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:rem:elliptic-stability-locus","label":"rem:elliptic-stability-locus","md":"quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.IntegerPointIdentificationHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.IntegerPointIdentificationHolds","kind":"opaque","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L35-L38","doc":"**Algebraic claim (integer-point identification)**: the\nvalley of stability in `(Z, N)` integer lattice coincides\nwith the integer points of the Weierstrass curve above. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.WeierstrassFormHolds","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.EllipticStabilityLocus.WeierstrassFormHolds","kind":"opaque","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/predicted-spectra/elliptic-stability-locus.lean#L29-L33","doc":"**Algebraic claim (Weierstrass form)**: the (Coulomb +\npairing) part of the nuclear binding ansatz, after rescaling\nby m_e, reduces to a Weierstrass elliptic curve over the\ncolor-tube fibration of Bring's surface (`def:color-tube-fibers`). ","signatureChunk":0}]}